### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login as student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@carsu.edu.ph",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as vendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor1@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register - should be rejected (Gmail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "outsider@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Outsider"
}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### VENDOR - list my menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### VENDOR - blocked for students (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### VENDOR - add menu item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "name": "Matcha Latte",
  "category": "Beverages",
  "price": 65,
  "stock_qty": 12
}

### VENDOR - toggle sold out (item 9)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu/9/sold-out
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### VENDOR - restock item 10
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu/10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "stock_qty": 25
}


### STUDENT - place an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "slot_id": 6,
  "items": [{ "item_id": 8, "quantity": 2 }]
}

### STUDENT - my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### VENDOR - order queue (grouped by status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### VENDOR - only pending orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/orders?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### VENDOR - advance to PREPARING (change the id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/orders/11/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "status": "preparing"
}

### VENDOR - illegal jump, expect 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/orders/11/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "status": "CLAIMED"
}

### VENDOR - daily summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/orders/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### STUDENT - list stalls
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/stalls
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### STUDENT - view a stall's menu (change the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/stalls/3/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### STUDENT - view a stall's pickup slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/stalls/3/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Rename a menu item / change price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/menu/8
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "name": "Tapsilog Special",
  "price": 70
}

### VENDOR - generate slots
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/slots/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

{
  "open_time": "22:15",
  "close_time": "23:45",
  "interval_minutes": 15,
  "capacity": 10
}